  "Id": "593590aa-b2c6-42d7-b9c5-ce205ee4266d"/*TriangulateGeometry*/,
  "Description": "Converts all N-gon faces of a geometry into triangles (fan triangulation for convex faces), remapping corner attributes and part ranges.\n\nRendering triangulates implicitly in [GeometryToMeshBuffers] - use this op when downstream geometry operations need triangles explicitly.",
